content.text:
Now also fix the footer 479px `button-secondary-small` — Webflow at 479px sets `position: relative; right: auto` but our module also has `inset: auto` + `top: auto; transform: none`. Let me check what Webflow actually sets:

The 479px block (line 29941):
```css
.button-secondary-small {
  margin-top: 10px;
  position: relative;
  right: auto;
}
```

The module has all that but also `top: auto; transform: none; inset: auto; width: 100%` — those aren't in Webflow. Let me fix to match exactly:

input.old_string:
.button-secondary-small {
  margin-top: 10px;
  position: relative;
  right: auto;
  top: auto;
  transform: none;
  inset: auto;
  width: 100%;
}

